# ---- RADIUS .gitignore ----
#
# STRATEGY: deny by default for every class of generated artifact, then re-include
# named, curated exceptions. The default answer for anything a run produces is "not
# published"; publishing is an explicit act.
#
# This file prevents accidents. It is NOT review, and a file it fails to match is
# NOT thereby approved for publication. See docs/methodology/PUBLICATION_POLICY.md
# and run infrastructure/publication_checklist.md before every push.
#
# `git add .` is not a publication mechanism. Stage by path.

# =====================================================================
# 1. Generated experiment output  (policy 2.3 PRIVATE/LOCAL)
# =====================================================================
# results/ is curated, so it is denied wholesale and re-opened for the
# specific artifact types that carry metadata and are small enough to publish.
results/**
!results/*/
!results/**/README.md
!results/**/manifest.json
!results/**/*.csv
!results/**/figures/
!results/**/figures/*.png
!results/**/figures/*.svg
!results/**/figures/*.py

# Per-run directories and bulk ensembles are never published.
# These come after the re-inclusions above and therefore override them.
**/run_[0-9]*/
**/runs/
**/raw/
**/raw_data/
**/monte_carlo/
**/mc_output/
**/ensemble/
**/output/
**/outputs/
**/generated/
**/unreviewed/

# Bulk numeric formats: regenerable from config + seed (docs/PROVENANCE.md section 4).
*.npz
*.npy
*.parquet
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pkl
*.mat
*.feather
# Exception: small analytical reference solutions kept as regression fixtures.
# Each is added deliberately, with a README documenting units, frame and origin.
!validation/reference/**

# =====================================================================
# 2. Scratch, logs, caches, debug  (policy 2.3 / 2.4)
# =====================================================================
scratch/
tmp/
temp/
cache/
.cache/
debug/
logs/
*.log
*.out
*.err
profile_*.txt
*.prof
# The research log is a curated decision record, not a runtime log.
!research/research_log/*.md

# =====================================================================
# 3. Secrets and credentials  (policy 2.4 NEVER PUBLISH)
# =====================================================================
# Publish config.example.yaml; never a config carrying a credential.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer
secrets.*
credentials.*
*credentials*.json
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.token
.netrc
.npmrc
.pypirc
.aws/
.ssh/

# =====================================================================
# 4. Local machine and environment  (policy 2.4 NEVER PUBLISH)
# =====================================================================
.venv/
venv/
env/
.python-version
.direnv/
*.local.yaml
*.local.yml
*.local.json
local_config/
machine_specific/

# =====================================================================
# 5. AI interaction records  (policy section 7 - NEVER PUBLISH)
# =====================================================================
agent_transcripts/
ai_conversations/
transcripts/
prompts/
.claude/
*.transcript.md
personal_notes/

# =====================================================================
# 6. Notebooks  (policy 2.2 - PUBLIC ONLY AFTER REVIEW)
# =====================================================================
# Denied unconditionally, including under notebooks/ and examples/. A notebook
# enters the repository only by `git add -f`, after it is cleaned of exploratory
# cells, local paths and stored outputs, and reviewed as scientifically useful.
# The force-add IS the review step: there is deliberately no path that publishes a
# notebook by accident.
*.ipynb
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# =====================================================================
# 7. Python build and tooling artifacts
# =====================================================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# =====================================================================
# 8. OS and editor
# =====================================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
